<description>&lt;p&gt;A pipe bomb exploded in Yala province, wounding five army officers, and a separate bomb injured five security volunteers in the same province. An air hostess is linked to a trafficking ring that smuggles Chinese nationals across the Thai-Malaysian border. Cambodian Prime Minister Hun Manet and Thai officials are exchanging accusations over a border dispute while continuing maritime border talks, and a fiberoptic cable was discovered linking a border house to a Myanmar casino operation. The conflict recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.euronews.com/video/2026/10/15/thailand-bangkok-protesters-decry-imf-and-world-bank-warn-of-destructive-capitalism&quot;&gt;Euronews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/week-asia/lifestyle-culture/article/3371180/shunned-west-ye-hands-indonesia-rare-mega-tour-coup?utm_source=rss_feed&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/asia/southeast-asia/article/3371223/thai-people-already-poor-developing-nations-protest-imfs-austerity-call?utm_source=rss_feed&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNWHRoa0w1ZmxFQlNWWkF4dC1UTjVLd2tUNzdTUE1GU0hFWmRHUXpqdkhEVVFRNDIwSklMRDJROXM1akswRV9Rbzdud0NCZW1TUC1iOTNtTElsRWhQeG9zcFZraGQyUEJnOXM2cHlIbEdLNDhyckR0UkJJTi12TkJtc0JsRU5xZVBTT3dTYUtiY2FEc3pPLThVaWRGZjJvdGthWFRJaE5ZZEQ2LTJnc0NwRjZHaV9rVzdJa2hpRWtvVXZHQnoy?oc=5&quot;&gt;Türkiye Today&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMif0FVX3lxTE5XTHdVajYxQ2VZTDFWWGdwc0dEN0JFOXRIcEIwNm9RVDl2RWVKTV9NdnAzVnZEOWpnZGNnV1M1M2xrTlRPMVZidkNFdEk5MnZ2aGMzcXc0LVFmLWo3ZDdjTG1GMX